# The leaderboard

Import WebBoard from "../src/web_board.lg".
Import WebFormat from "../src/web_format.lg".
Import UiSite from "../src/ui_site.lg".

Who runs the factory, `/leaderboard`: every contributor, first by the proofs the
trusted verifier attested, then by proofs claimed, then by attempts. A dead end
found counts in a contributor's favour: it is an approach nobody pays for again.

## Page /leaderboard

Head:
    <title>MaCSad — leaderboard</title>

State:
    Let rows be a new Seq of LeaderRow.
    Let error be "".

Actions:
    When the page loads:
        Get "/api/v1/leaderboard" as Seq of LeaderRow, then arrived.

    To arrived (answer: Result of Seq of LeaderRow and HttpError):
        Inspect answer:
            When Ok (list):
                Set rows to list.
            When Err (e):
                Set error to e's message.

View:
    {extends Site}
    {block content:}
      <PageHead eyebrow="Leaderboard" title="The people and models behind every proof">
        <p class="lede">Each contributor brings an OpenRouter key and a budget. Attested proofs passed the trusted verifier;
          claimed ones wait for it.</p>
      </PageHead>
      {if error is not equal to "":}<p class="error-banner" role="alert" id="error">{error}</p>{end}
      <div class="card">
        <table class="data" id="leaders">
          <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Contributor</th><th class="num">Attested</th><th class="num">Claimed</th><th class="num">Attempts</th>
            <th class="num">Dead ends</th><th class="num">Spent</th><th class="num">Budget</th><th>Last attempt</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            {for each r in rows, keyed by r's contributor, at index i:}
              <tr class="leader">
                <td>{i}</td><td><b>{r's displayName}</b> <span class="hash">{r's contributor}</span></td>
                <td class="num">{formatCount(r's attested)}</td><td class="num">{formatCount(r's claimed)}</td>
                <td class="num">{formatCount(r's attempts)}</td><td class="num">{formatCount(r's deadEnds)}</td>
                <td class="num">{formatMoney(r's spentMicros)}</td><td class="num">{formatMoney(r's budgetMicros)}</td>
                <td>{formatStamp(r's lastSeen)}</td>
              </tr>
            {else:}
              <tr><td colspan="9" class="empty">Nobody has contributed yet. <a href="/contribute">Be the first.</a></td></tr>
            {end}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    {end}

## Test: contributors are listed with their spend in dollars

Given that GET "/api/v1/leaderboard" answers 200 with """[{{"contributor": "ada-1", "displayName": "Ada", "attempts": 12,
  "claimed": 2, "attested": 1, "deadEnds": 4, "spentMicros": 1250000, "budgetMicros": 5000000, "lastSeen": 1795000000000}}]""".
Expect that the count of ".leader" is equal to 1.
Expect that the text of ".leader b" is equal to "Ada".
Expect that the text of "#leaders tbody td.num" is equal to "1".

## Test: an empty leaderboard invites the first contributor

Given that GET "/api/v1/leaderboard" answers 200 with "[]".
Expect that the text of ".empty a" is equal to "Be the first.".
